    <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package" xmi:id="_YBDnIOPxEfGg8KH2-CF6mA" name="Structure">
      <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_bO1McOR6EfGjsdib3d454A" annotatedElement="_D_9EUOR1EfGjsdib3d454A">
        <body>Omitted (not used): belt 6, index table 1, switches 1/4/5, sensors 6/7, stopper 7</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_2Xe6gOTXEfGHHe_n3jyJ4w" annotatedElement="_ISfQgOR1EfGjsdib3d454A">
        <body>Current config: NormalBelt (all 5), NormalIndexTable, 2× NormalGantryArm. BOM = 929 + 334 + 2*999 = 3,261 eur → price = 5,113.20 eur = defaultPrice . Belt price covers the full belt set; all belts share one speed class.&#xD;
</body>
      </ownedComment>
